// bastion (SEASON-0, row 42): the in-game year's length in DAYS — the
// tunable the season quarters derive from (common/src/time.rs::Season;
// year_phase/day_of_year use it too). 160 days = 4 seasons of 40, one
// season per the existing DAYS_IN_MONTH convention. Purely derived from
// the TimeOfDay master clock — retuning this NEVER drifts a running
// world (there is no stored season state to migrate).
(
    days_in_year: 160.0,
)
